<span class="line"><span></span></span></code></pre></div></div></div></div><div class="code-block-fade-overlay print:hidden" data-fade-overlay="true" aria-hidden="true" style="--fade-color-light:#ffffff;--fade-color-dark:#0B0C0E"></div></div><span data-as="p">If the install fails, match the message Claude Code reports:</span><ul>
<li><code>Marketplace &quot;claude-plugins-official&quot; not found</code>: add the marketplace with <code>/plugin marketplace add anthropics/claude-plugins-official</code>, then retry the install.</li>
<li>The plugin is <a class="link" href="/docs/en/discover-plugins#install-plugins">not found in the marketplace</a>: check the plugin name.</li>
</ul><span data-as="p">Check the install summary: if it reports <code>Run /reload-plugins to activate.</code>, run that command.</span></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="step group/step step-container relative flex items-start pb-5"><div data-component-part="step-line" class="absolute w-px h-[calc(100%-2.75rem)] top-11 bg-transparent bg-linear-to-b from-gray-200 dark:from-white/10 via-80% to-transparent group-has-[[data-component-part=&quot;step-content&quot;]:empty]/step:hidden" contentEditable="false"></div><div class="absolute ml-[-13px] py-2" data-component-part="step-number" contentEditable="false"><div class="group/step-indicator relative size-7 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-50 dark:bg-white/10 text-xs text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-50 font-semibold flex items-center justify-center"><div class="group-has-[a:focus-visible]/step-indicator:opacity-0">2</div></div></div><div class="w-full overflow-hidden pl-8 pr-px"><p class="mt-2 font-semibold prose dark:prose-invert text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-200" contentEditable="false" data-component-part="step-title">Run the build skill</p><div data-component-part="step-content" class="prose dark:prose-invert"><div class="code-block mt-5 mb-8 not-prose rounded-2xl relative group min-w-0 print:print-color-exact text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 dark:twoslash-dark bg-transparent dark:bg-transparent" numberOfLines="2" language="text"><div data-floating-buttons="true" class="absolute top-3 right-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 print:hidden"><div class="z-10 select-none" id="base-ui-_R_uldo2sllktbsnlhjiuasnpfiutb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><button class="size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md group/code-snippet-feedback-button in-data-floating-buttons:group-[:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))]:bg-gray-100 dark:in-data-floating-buttons:group-[:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))]:bg-gray-800" id="code-snippet-feedback-button" aria-label="Report incorre